  "headline": "FDA's records show metronidazole injection has been on the shortage list since 2022-01-13 and remains Current as of 2026-10-16",
  "headline_cites": ["E39", "E36"],
  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "FDA's shortage list shows metronidazole injection from Baxter Healthcare has been Current since its initial posting on 2022-01-13 and was last updated on 2026-10-16.",
      "cites": ["E39", "E36"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The shortage has been on FDA's list for 57 months as of 2026-10-21.",
      "cites": ["D6"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Baxter Healthcare Corporation's plant at FEI 1416980 received an OAI classification on 2024-08-01 and again on 2026-04-02, with a Warning Letter issued on 2026-09-29.",
      "cites": ["E13", "E15", "E16"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Another Baxter plant at FEI 2618677 has a history of multiple OAI classifications from 2010 through 2016, with the most recent inspection VAI on 2024-07-19.",
      "cites": ["E21", "E24", "E26", "E28", "E29", "E31"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Corvale East holds 139 units of B. Braun metronidazole 500 mg/100 mL solution with 9.6 days on hand, while Corvale General holds 338 units with 21.7 days on hand.",
      "cites": ["D1", "D2", "E1", "E5"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The recommended action is to transfer 64 units of 500 mg/100 mL solution from Corvale General to Corvale East, which would bring Corvale East to 14 days of supply while Corvale General maintains two weeks.",
      "cites": ["D7"]
    }
  ]
}
